{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "043G", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$(G, m)$", "MATH_0004": "$G$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$m : G \\times_B G \\to G$", "MATH_0007": "$B$", "MATH_0008": "$T$", "MATH_0009": "$B$", "MATH_0010": "$(G(T), m)$", "MATH_0011": "$\\psi : (G, m) \\to (G', m')$", "MATH_0012": "$B$", "MATH_0013": "$\\psi : G \\to G'$", "MATH_0014": "$B$", "MATH_0015": "$T/B$", "MATH_0016": "$\\psi : G(T) \\to G'(T)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-notation}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-group-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:68747e4cb68f8cc0a8c03a52796a2ae16d6974af3f9d27361bb95da0e475bd0c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cd305c685b84211ad6596cc109578610fac0e3340c1ce882f78477bf27aff89a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> as in Section <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>group algebraic space over <MATH_0002><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is a pair <MATH_0003>, where\n<MATH_0004> is an algebraic space over <MATH_0005> and <MATH_0006> is\na morphism of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0007> with the following property:\nFor every scheme <MATH_0008> over <MATH_0009> the pair <MATH_0010> is a group.\n<STRUCT_0003> A <TEXTITOPEN_0002>morphism <MATH_0011> of\ngroup algebraic spaces over <MATH_0012><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\nis a morphism <MATH_0013> of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0014> such that for\nevery <MATH_0015> the induced map <MATH_0016> is a homomorphism\nof groups.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1b023d77e453ef344a14e8b09