{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "043G", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(G, m)$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$e : B \\to G$", "MATH_0005": "$i : G \\to G$", "MATH_0006": "$T$", "MATH_0007": "$(G(T), m, e, i)$", "MATH_0008": "$(G, m)$", "MATH_0009": "$(G', m')$", "MATH_0010": "$B$", "MATH_0011": "$f : G \\to G'$", "MATH_0012": "$B$", "MATH_0013": "$f$", "MATH_0014": "$B$", "MATH_0015": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nG \\times_B G \\ar[r]_-{f \\times f} \\ar[d]_m &\nG' \\times_B G' \\ar[d]^m \\\\\nG \\ar[r]^f & G'\n}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{groupoids-section-group-schemes}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9f9df56515de797647a1da501a6de9b2136df60d6bbdf5277a05f0adcbc6acac", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7bf5787b385f1cca57631447043758e47479d2e1d05707ef2b7cc45148099882", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a group algebraic space over the algebraic space <MATH_0002>.\nBy the discussion in\nGroupoids, Section <REF_0001>\nwe obtain morphisms of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>\n(identity) <MATH_0004> and (inverse) <MATH_0005> such that\nfor every <MATH_0006> the quadruple <MATH_0007> satisfies the\naxioms of a group.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nLet <MATH_0008>, <MATH_0009> be group algebraic spaces over <MATH_0010>.\nLet <MATH_0011> be a morphism of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0012>.\nIt follows from the definition that <MATH_0013> is a morphism\nof group algebraic spaces over <MATH_0014> if and only if the following diagram\nis commutative:\n<MATH_0015>\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:41ee62edd436ad39aaa3ebad563dd9321c5462ce9391f601a1fe88467d2d3286", "unit_id": "tag:043G:prose-0002"}
